story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,69,40,41,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,69,40,41,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"98","reputation":"8100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10064","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,69,40,41,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"98","reputation":"8100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁术麾下武将之一。参与攻杀扬州刺史陈温、争夺淮南控制权等关键战役。同袁术军队进攻吕布败退、又遇曹操进攻寿春时，担任先锋迎战曹操军队。但因不敌夏侯惇而被其三回合斩落马下。","tc":"袁術麾下武將之一。參與攻殺揚州刺史陳溫、爭奪淮南控制權等關鍵戰役。同袁術軍隊進攻呂布敗退、又遇曹操進攻壽春時，擔任先鋒迎戰曹操軍隊。但因不敵夏侯惇而被其三回合斬落馬下。","en":"One of the officers under Yuan Shu. He took part in key campaigns such as the attack and slaying of Chen Wen, Lt. Governor of Yang Province, and the struggle for control of Huainan. After retreating with Yuan Shu's army following their failed assault on Lu Bu, and then facing Cao Cao's attack on Shouchun, he served as vanguard to confront Cao Cao's forces. However, he was no match for Xiahou Dun, who struck him down from his horse within three bouts.","jp":"袁術配下の武将の一人。揚州刺史の陳温を攻め殺し、淮南の支配権を争うなどの重要な戦いに参加した。袁術軍とともに呂布を攻めるも敗退し、曹操が寿春に侵攻してきた際には、先鋒を務めて曹操軍を迎え撃った。しかし夏侯惇に敵わず、3ターンで馬から斬り落とされた。","kr":"원술 휘하의 무장 중 한 명이다. 양주자사 진온을 공격해 살해하고 회남의 지배권을 다투는 등 주요 전투에 참전했다. 원술군과 함께 여포를 공격했다가 패퇴하였으며, 조조가 수춘을 침공했을 때는 선봉을 맡아 조조군에 맞섰다. 그러나 하후돈을 당해내지 못하고 3합 만에 말 아래로 베여 떨어졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10299","remark":"","surname":"桥","surnameTc":"橋","surnameEn":"Qiao","surnameJp":"橋","surnameKr":"교","surnameOther":"","name":"蕤","nameTc":"蕤","nameEn":"Rui","nameJp":"蕤","nameKr":"유","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"桥蕤","power":"WJ10064","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1045","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"69","wise":"40","politics":"41","charm":"58","will":"62","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"22/22/66/22/22/10/50/22","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"4700","debateSoulPoint":"1400","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/3/0/1/0/1/1/1/0/1/2/2/1/0/3/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"91","loyalty":"98","reputation":"8100","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"8","birth":"143","show":"184","death":"198","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1020105","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;10/1;25/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"袁术麾下武将之一。参与攻杀扬州刺史陈温、争夺淮南控制权等关键战役。同袁术军队进攻吕布败退、又遇曹操进攻寿春时，担任先锋迎战曹操军队。但因不敌夏侯惇而被其三回合斩落马下。","descriptionTc":"袁術麾下武將之一。參與攻殺揚州刺史陳溫、爭奪淮南控制權等關鍵戰役。同袁術軍隊進攻呂布敗退、又遇曹操進攻壽春時，擔任先鋒迎戰曹操軍隊。